{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model with multiprofile configuration, avgpool aggregation, and concat fusion, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6186 and F1 of 0.6103, higher than previous multimodal singleprofile baselines. The results suggest multiprofile and aggregation choices may contribute to performance gains, but the relative impact of these factors remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative aggregation strategies. The effectiveness of concat fusion in this context also requires further validation."
}

